                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Consul</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bordeaux :</hi></p>
                <p>I do hereby certify that the annexed seal and signature are those of Cortes
                    president of the tribunal of commerce of Bordeaux, and that to all official acts
                    thus attested full faith and credit are and ought to be given.</p>
                <p>Witness my hand and official seal this 24th day of February, 1864.</p>
                <p>[SEAL]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C DAVISSON, <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul,
                        Bordeaux.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
